WEBVTT

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:21.000
I rip my inescapable fate
to pieces and move forward

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.770
accepting the unavoidable reality in my heart

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:32.540
At the end of the sorrow and hardship

00:00:32.540 --> 00:00:37.480
my writhing soul heads towards the light

00:00:37.480 --> 00:00:43.320
I shout... I grant...

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:50.000
And I head past the unwavering obsessions

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:55.700
Even if just for a moment,
hold me, heart and all, in your arms

00:00:55.700 --> 00:01:00.870
So I can feel the warmth of happiness

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:06.680
I destroy... I try...

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:13.190
I just have to live with all my might

00:01:13.190 --> 00:01:18.860
I don't feel Ioneliness
since I left it somewhere

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:24.000
Kindness... sympathy...
I don't need either of them now...

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:27.760
Shine the light!

00:01:31.406 --> 00:01:32.336
Ouri-kun!

00:01:32.336 --> 00:01:34.776
Where are you?! Hoshimura-san!

00:01:35.176 --> 00:01:38.346
Hey! Where are you?!

00:01:38.346 --> 00:01:41.006
He should still be
suffering from that injury!

00:01:46.916 --> 00:01:48.816
Hey, you can't take him on!

00:01:48.816 --> 00:01:50.656
I will do it!

00:01:51.256 --> 00:01:55.656
How's this? Which Brother do you like?

00:02:21.556 --> 00:02:24.286
Don't flatter yourself, lad.

00:02:24.286 --> 00:02:30.316
To harm me, a mere human like you would
have to use a surprise attack or something.

00:02:31.666 --> 00:02:32.836
Ouri!

00:02:32.836 --> 00:02:34.856
Stop it, Makina!

00:02:35.296 --> 00:02:37.036
How disgraceful...

00:02:37.036 --> 00:02:42.406
I know he just has
Brother's face, but I felt awful.

00:02:42.406 --> 00:02:46.366
I told you.
No one else should feel this way!

00:02:57.526 --> 00:02:59.996
Ouri! Don't just flail it about!

00:02:59.996 --> 00:03:03.326
Concentrate your attention
on the tip of your staff!

00:03:06.696 --> 00:03:11.396
You're just mere humans
confined in small, weak bodies.

00:03:16.176 --> 00:03:18.436
Die...

00:03:42.966 --> 00:03:44.706
Ouri...

00:03:44.706 --> 00:03:46.376
Zadan technique...

00:03:46.376 --> 00:03:51.246
a miracle that the Kougon Sect's
contracted monks learn through training...

00:03:51.246 --> 00:03:54.476
So when he beat Ena earlier, it
wasn't because of a surprise attack.

00:03:54.476 --> 00:03:57.946
But... how can Ouri do it when he
hasn't gone through the full training?

00:03:57.946 --> 00:04:01.256
A zadan technique isn't the monk's power.

00:04:01.256 --> 00:04:06.086
It's the act of borrowing power from the
stars and the gods, who are protecting him.

00:04:07.726 --> 00:04:13.326
He, too, is receiving protection...
from many places...

00:04:42.356 --> 00:04:47.136
Hey, would you please
stop hiding and come out?!

00:04:47.136 --> 00:04:50.196
Don't you wanna be happy?

00:04:52.006 --> 00:04:55.536
Happy? To be killed by you?!

00:04:55.536 --> 00:05:00.516
The greatest happiness
is to die happy, right?

00:05:00.516 --> 00:05:03.706
Can anything else be called happiness?

00:05:18.666 --> 00:05:21.196
Are you saying that we should've just died?

00:05:21.196 --> 00:05:23.006
Don't let him get to you.

00:05:23.006 --> 00:05:27.066
That Seven Stars member has the
power to manipulate people's minds.

00:05:30.076 --> 00:05:34.536
Phew... So these guys were just puppets.

00:05:35.846 --> 00:05:36.646
Ouri!

00:05:36.646 --> 00:05:38.016
What?

00:05:38.016 --> 00:05:41.516
It's not a puppet. It's me, you damn brat!

00:05:41.516 --> 00:05:44.426
Seven Stars! But he surely was...

00:05:45.686 --> 00:05:50.716
I don't die. Eternal life, that's
precisely what the Seven Stars are.

00:05:52.426 --> 00:05:56.166
Ena manipulates corpses and
transfers his soul into one of them.

00:05:56.166 --> 00:05:58.936
They're all his spare bodies.

00:05:58.936 --> 00:06:00.096
Spares?!

00:06:01.406 --> 00:06:07.436
That's right. I'm a free
existence that isn't confined to a body!

00:06:13.116 --> 00:06:16.886
Then, I'll just crush all the bodies
you're planning to switch to. That's all!

00:06:16.886 --> 00:06:19.046
Smart, young man.

00:06:31.266 --> 00:06:33.706
Th-they're crazy!

00:06:33.706 --> 00:06:36.576
Don't your hearts ache seeing their faces?

00:06:36.576 --> 00:06:38.206
Say what you want!

00:06:43.986 --> 00:06:47.146
There's no more spare
corpses that you can switch to!

00:06:49.256 --> 00:06:52.956
Toya! Toya, what're you doing?!

00:06:54.896 --> 00:06:58.916
Ena, how long are you
planning to fool around?

00:07:00.996 --> 00:07:03.836
Here's a present for you, Ena.

00:07:07.736 --> 00:07:09.936
Thanks, Toya.

00:07:22.656 --> 00:07:24.526
Hmph.

00:07:24.526 --> 00:07:26.326
Darn...

00:07:26.326 --> 00:07:30.596
I didn't wanna use this
body because I like it so much.

00:07:30.596 --> 00:07:32.766
It's too late to act innocent now.

00:07:32.766 --> 00:07:36.936
That body was just another
corpse from somewhere anyway, right?

00:07:36.936 --> 00:07:41.966
Your words hurt me.
I'll punish you first then.

00:07:43.346 --> 00:07:45.006
Take this!

00:07:47.816 --> 00:07:49.436
Sadahiro!

00:07:53.116 --> 00:07:56.676
Looks like this is going to
be more than just punishment.

00:07:58.356 --> 00:08:02.456
In order to become a more beautiful,
more perfect existence,

00:08:02.456 --> 00:08:06.166
I created this body by
gathering and using many corpses.

00:08:06.166 --> 00:08:08.396
This body really is the best.

00:08:08.396 --> 00:08:13.866
How's the power of my curse?
I won't miss this time.

00:08:20.316 --> 00:08:21.646
Hoshimura-san...

00:08:21.646 --> 00:08:25.146
You can call me Makina.
You're my contracted monk, right?

00:08:25.146 --> 00:08:26.416
What?

00:08:26.416 --> 00:08:31.686
Oh? A beautiful friendship between a
dead person and a living person, huh?

00:08:31.686 --> 00:08:35.486
You should abandon
everything too, like I did.

00:08:35.896 --> 00:08:40.536
You can evolve into something
more beautiful and stronger.

00:08:40.536 --> 00:08:42.936
The dead need to evolve?!

00:08:54.246 --> 00:08:55.576
Makina!

00:08:57.186 --> 00:09:02.556
Your regrets are useless against my curse.

00:09:07.256 --> 00:09:09.526
Seven Stars...

00:09:18.036 --> 00:09:19.626
Makina...

00:09:20.736 --> 00:09:23.276
No, no, that's useless.

00:09:23.276 --> 00:09:28.046
This high-speed spinning
can scrape your fingers easily.

00:09:28.046 --> 00:09:31.716
I wonder if you'll lose your
wrist as well if this keeps up...

00:09:31.716 --> 00:09:38.156
Well, that would be perfect for recreating
you and giving you to Hokuto, though.

00:09:38.156 --> 00:09:39.726
Are you okay, Ouri?

00:09:39.726 --> 00:09:42.556
His Rune is being absorbed.

00:09:47.336 --> 00:09:51.136
What?! She stopped the spinning?! Can't be...

00:09:51.136 --> 00:09:55.436
Her fingers are regenerating
faster than being scraped?!

00:09:55.436 --> 00:09:58.906
No Shikabane can regenerate that fast...

00:09:58.906 --> 00:10:02.016
It's as if she has an ability
to regenerate infinitely...

00:10:02.016 --> 00:10:05.586
I get it! This is your!

00:10:05.586 --> 00:10:07.606
Curse!

00:10:10.456 --> 00:10:13.156
My curse isn't an ordinary curse.

00:10:13.156 --> 00:10:16.496
It's power comes from
two regrets put together!

00:10:31.276 --> 00:10:36.716
Beautifully... Beautifully...

00:10:36.716 --> 00:10:42.156
More beautifully... The true beauty...

00:10:42.156 --> 00:10:45.456
This isn't me. This isn't me.

00:10:45.456 --> 00:10:49.016
The real... The real me is!

00:10:57.006 --> 00:10:58.166
Stop it! Stop it!

00:10:58.166 --> 00:11:00.076
- I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
- You thought you could abandon
your body and become someone else?

00:11:00.076 --> 00:11:02.176
- This isn't me. I... I...
- You thought you could abandon
your body and become someone else?

00:11:02.176 --> 00:11:05.206
No! This isn't me! I!

00:11:05.206 --> 00:11:07.516
Do you call that living as you please?!

00:11:07.516 --> 00:11:12.016
I... I... I... No... No...
No... No... No... No...

00:11:12.016 --> 00:11:14.186
- This isn't me... This isn't me...
- I won't abandon myself...
until I destroy you all.

00:11:14.186 --> 00:11:18.056
- No... No... No... No... No!
- I won't abandon myself...
until I destroy you all.

00:11:18.056 --> 00:11:19.216
This isn't me...

00:11:32.006 --> 00:11:34.596
Hoshimura-san, Kagami-kun...

00:11:49.556 --> 00:11:52.356
Good evening, mademoiselle.

00:11:55.356 --> 00:11:58.056
What does death mean to you?

00:12:00.266 --> 00:12:01.866
What's death?

00:12:01.866 --> 00:12:07.106
The most beautiful thing...
The greatest happiness...

00:12:07.106 --> 00:12:09.206
That's exactly right.

00:12:09.206 --> 00:12:14.446
I finally met someone who
has the same idea as mine.

00:12:14.446 --> 00:12:17.616
Makina Hoshimura is beautiful...

00:12:17.616 --> 00:12:20.656
it must be because she's dead.

00:12:20.656 --> 00:12:26.086
Death is beautiful. I adore death.

00:12:26.086 --> 00:12:31.066
I don't want to live
an ordinary life like this.

00:12:31.066 --> 00:12:35.836
But Ouri-kun and Makina-san
are on the other side...

00:12:35.836 --> 00:12:40.236
Why am I... living an ordinary, boring...

00:12:40.236 --> 00:12:44.476
I'll give you something wonderful.

00:12:44.476 --> 00:12:47.636
Now, become happy.

00:12:49.016 --> 00:12:51.686
You can do anything.

00:12:51.686 --> 00:12:56.276
And you'll die at the peak of happiness.

00:12:58.526 --> 00:13:00.516
I'm happy...

00:13:07.496 --> 00:13:10.706
Don't push yourself. Rest a while.

00:13:10.706 --> 00:13:12.666
Are you all right?

00:13:12.666 --> 00:13:17.166
I'm all right... I have to get used to this.

00:13:19.176 --> 00:13:20.846
I'm Akira Tooka.

00:13:20.846 --> 00:13:22.176
I wonder if you're senior to me...

00:13:22.176 --> 00:13:26.456
Yeah... I think I've been with him
for three years working on this and that.

00:13:26.456 --> 00:13:29.786
Why the dissatisfied tone?

00:13:29.786 --> 00:13:33.626
Then by any chance have you
destroyed close to 108 Shikabane?

00:13:33.626 --> 00:13:35.996
I hope you can go to heaven soon.

00:13:35.996 --> 00:13:37.226
Uhm...

00:13:37.226 --> 00:13:38.796
Ouri-kun!

00:13:38.796 --> 00:13:40.996
Are you there, Makinan?!

00:13:40.996 --> 00:13:43.866
It's better not to tell anyone about us.

00:13:43.866 --> 00:13:47.706
We won't tell anyone
about your curse, either.

00:13:50.176 --> 00:13:55.206
Our target is the traitor monk,
so... See ya!

00:13:58.316 --> 00:14:03.586
Traitor monk...
Is she allowed to kill humans?

00:14:06.696 --> 00:14:10.226
The Seven Stars are totally
different from the usual Shikabane

00:14:10.226 --> 00:14:16.726
in that they have a clear
intention and act in a group.

00:14:17.066 --> 00:14:23.166
And their purpose is clearly
to harm us, the Kougon Sect.

00:14:23.576 --> 00:14:26.846
Though they are the Seven Stars,
they are nothing but Shikabane.

00:14:26.846 --> 00:14:30.246
Two stars out of seven have already fallen.

00:14:30.246 --> 00:14:35.186
We will now set up an absolute defense
perimeter centered around this head temple

00:14:35.186 --> 00:14:38.216
and annihilate the remaining
Seven Stars early on.

00:14:38.626 --> 00:14:42.256
This is an imperial ordinance
from His Grace Dai-Sojo.

00:14:43.866 --> 00:14:48.236
Now, start preparing for battle
under the leadership of the Guardians.

00:14:48.236 --> 00:14:49.366
Excuse me!

00:14:49.366 --> 00:14:50.706
Ouri!

00:14:50.706 --> 00:14:53.536
Whoa! What guts Ouri has...

00:14:53.536 --> 00:14:56.906
when he's just joined the Kougon Sect...

00:14:56.906 --> 00:14:58.946
I hope he won't be scolded.

00:14:58.946 --> 00:15:03.146
I don't think their goal is just
to come after the Kougon Sect.

00:15:03.146 --> 00:15:05.816
What is their true goal?

00:15:05.816 --> 00:15:08.656
Restrain yourself, Dai-Sozu Kagami!

00:15:08.656 --> 00:15:11.986
You are only here due
to extraordinary circumstances.

00:15:11.986 --> 00:15:16.496
But I've encountered the Seven Stars
many times. And the traitor monk was...

00:15:16.496 --> 00:15:18.656
Restrain yourself!

00:15:19.996 --> 00:15:22.896
Dai-Sozu Kagami...

00:15:22.896 --> 00:15:25.066
Your Grace Dai-Sojo...

00:15:25.066 --> 00:15:29.776
Then what do you think
the Seven Stars'  true goal is?

00:15:29.776 --> 00:15:32.606
He is... the Dai-Sojo...

00:15:32.606 --> 00:15:34.616
You cannot answer, can you...

00:15:34.616 --> 00:15:38.346
The Seven Stars consider
us as their enemy. That's all.

00:15:39.186 --> 00:15:40.806
I don't know.

00:15:41.316 --> 00:15:45.356
Are you suggesting that we
should not fight the Seven Stars?

00:15:45.356 --> 00:15:51.986
No. We will destroy the
Seven Stars... as it is our wish.

00:15:52.996 --> 00:15:54.656
Whoa!

00:15:58.006 --> 00:16:01.496
"As it is our wish"...

00:16:05.606 --> 00:16:08.776
Seriously, I broke into a cold sweat.

00:16:08.776 --> 00:16:12.686
Well... Did I do something bad?

00:16:13.516 --> 00:16:15.056
Are you brain dead?!

00:16:15.056 --> 00:16:19.626
An imperial ordinance is something
that we just have to obey once issued.

00:16:19.626 --> 00:16:21.826
We're not allowed to ask questions.

00:16:21.826 --> 00:16:25.026
Then it's as if they're orders by god.

00:16:25.026 --> 00:16:30.306
That's right. The Dai-Sojo is
considered to be equal to god.

00:16:30.306 --> 00:16:32.836
He's also the only one
who can carry out the code

00:16:32.836 --> 00:16:36.706
to create Shikabane Hime
in a complete manner.

00:16:40.846 --> 00:16:41.976
So this is it, huh?

00:16:41.976 --> 00:16:44.516
This is something Senior Tagami left.

00:16:44.516 --> 00:16:47.256
Isn't this a memento for you?

00:16:47.256 --> 00:16:48.586
What?

00:16:49.716 --> 00:16:54.696
But... I still think that you should have this.

00:16:54.696 --> 00:16:59.196
If you are to learn a zadan technique,
you'll need a catalyst, so...

00:16:59.196 --> 00:17:01.066
But I...

00:17:01.066 --> 00:17:02.366
Take it.

00:17:02.366 --> 00:17:03.406
What?

00:17:03.406 --> 00:17:08.336
By wearing that, you may
become a little less of a burden.

00:17:08.336 --> 00:17:09.776
She didn't mean that!

00:17:09.776 --> 00:17:13.406
Th-that's not what
you meant, right, Makina?

00:17:15.016 --> 00:17:16.776
Uhm...

00:17:25.586 --> 00:17:28.286
Hm? What?

00:17:30.626 --> 00:17:32.686
That's...

00:17:33.936 --> 00:17:36.426
the Breast Goddess?!

00:17:38.366 --> 00:17:41.576
It's amazing...
I went to see her earlier, too.

00:17:41.576 --> 00:17:43.376
It's none of my concern!

00:17:43.376 --> 00:17:48.316
What're you sulking about?
I didn't realize that she was that pretty.

00:17:48.316 --> 00:17:50.746
That's not the Breast Goddess!

00:17:50.746 --> 00:17:52.316
What're you saying?

00:17:52.316 --> 00:17:57.826
It's nothing unusual that a girl looks
totally different after holidays, right?

00:17:57.826 --> 00:18:03.226
I can't explain, but my Breast Goddess
wasn't full of confidence like that.

00:18:03.226 --> 00:18:07.736
I liked her because she was fragile as
if she seemed somehow always troubled.

00:18:07.736 --> 00:18:10.566
Dammit! What's Ouri doing?!

00:18:10.566 --> 00:18:12.066
Yeah...

00:18:12.066 --> 00:18:14.126
Really, I wonder what he's doing...

00:18:21.176 --> 00:18:22.516
That's enough.

00:18:22.516 --> 00:18:26.316
What?! What're you saying?
We're just getting started.

00:18:26.316 --> 00:18:32.086
I've never done this with a boy
before so I thought I'd feel happier.

00:18:32.086 --> 00:18:36.666
This isn't good. I have to
become happier and happier.

00:18:36.666 --> 00:18:39.166
Hey, this isn't fair.

00:18:39.166 --> 00:18:41.266
You become happy, too.

00:18:41.266 --> 00:18:42.526
Huh?

00:18:55.646 --> 00:18:59.376
I feel great, Nozomi...

00:19:06.286 --> 00:19:09.156
Wonderful...

00:19:09.156 --> 00:19:12.666
Nozomi! What on earth happened to you?

00:19:12.666 --> 00:19:15.966
I feel very happy now.

00:19:16.666 --> 00:19:19.366
I feel like any wish I make will be granted.

00:19:19.366 --> 00:19:21.376
Happy?

00:19:21.376 --> 00:19:26.336
Shall I make you... happy, too?

00:19:40.226 --> 00:19:41.356
Lock the door.

00:19:41.356 --> 00:19:42.726
What?

00:19:42.726 --> 00:19:44.896
I-It's okay to come in?

00:19:44.896 --> 00:19:48.396
Yeah. I don't have anything
that I don't want you to see.

00:19:48.396 --> 00:19:50.696
Well then, I'll come in.

00:19:55.406 --> 00:19:57.876
So you only eat this kind of stuff...

00:19:57.876 --> 00:20:03.216
The truth is that I'm okay even
if I don't eat... since I'm dead.

00:20:03.216 --> 00:20:07.056
But I get hungry.

00:20:07.056 --> 00:20:09.516
It's strange, isn't it...

00:20:10.756 --> 00:20:15.526
But I didn't realize that the
contracted monk has to pay for it all.

00:20:15.526 --> 00:20:16.726
Whoa!

00:20:16.726 --> 00:20:19.926
Providing for your
Shikabane Hime is also your job.

00:20:19.926 --> 00:20:21.366
Do you feel like quitting now?

00:20:21.366 --> 00:20:25.466
Ah, no, I-I don't.

00:20:33.816 --> 00:20:38.276
Are you serious... about accepting
my curse and contracting with me?

00:20:39.546 --> 00:20:41.036
Yes.

00:20:41.886 --> 00:20:46.796
If I use my curse,
your body gets weakened.

00:20:46.796 --> 00:20:51.096
In the worst case, you'll...

00:20:51.096 --> 00:20:52.096
I've decided!

00:20:52.096 --> 00:20:53.466
Ah!

00:20:53.466 --> 00:20:59.456
Ah... Well, uhm... I've... d-decided.

00:21:08.416 --> 00:21:13.186
I love Keisei... even now for sure...

00:21:13.186 --> 00:21:15.156
What's the matter?

00:21:15.156 --> 00:21:18.516
Ah... Nothing.

00:21:33.506 --> 00:21:35.306
Kasuga-san?!

00:21:35.306 --> 00:21:37.506
Hey! Ah!

00:21:42.046 --> 00:21:44.986
K-Kasuga-san...

00:21:44.986 --> 00:21:47.456
Say, Ouri-kun...

00:21:47.456 --> 00:21:50.716
Kill... me...

00:21:54.956 --> 00:22:02.636
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:22:02.636 --> 00:22:06.666
I've just taken a big step forward

00:22:06.666 --> 00:22:14.346
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:22:14.346 --> 00:22:22.256
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:22:24.986 --> 00:22:30.766
"Is there a future where I'm headed?"

00:22:30.766 --> 00:22:36.696
I asked the gray sky above

00:22:36.696 --> 00:22:42.536
I can move forward only by fighting

00:22:42.536 --> 00:22:48.346
I live life ineptly, as it's the only way I know

00:22:48.346 --> 00:22:53.416
So I'm constantly struggling

00:22:53.416 --> 00:23:01.196
Dreaming of the day I reach the land of peace

00:23:01.196 --> 00:23:05.226
I've just taken a big step forward

00:23:05.226 --> 00:23:12.906
I won't look away from the reality
that seems like a shimmering illusion

00:23:12.906 --> 00:23:20.776
Even if I can't find the light anywhere

00:23:25.616 --> 00:23:28.286
I know you've known it for a while.

00:23:28.286 --> 00:23:31.386
It's so simple that there's no
room for misunderstanding it...

00:23:31.386 --> 00:23:35.756
